{"task_id": "HumanEval/57", "solution": "def monotonic(l: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True if list elements are monotonically increasing or decreasing.\n    This means the list is either entirely non-decreasing or entirely non-increasing.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(l) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    is_increasing = True\n    is_decreasing = True\n\n    for i in range(len(l) - 1):\n        if l[i] > l[i+1]:\n            is_increasing = False\n        if l[i] < l[i+1]:\n            is_decreasing = False\n\n        if not is_increasing and not is_decreasing:\n            return False\n\n    return is_increasing or is_decreasing"}
